---
source: crates/splot-cli/tests/help_snapshots.rs
expression: "help(\"validate\")"
---
Validate an AV2 length-delimited bitstream

Usage: splot validate [OPTIONS] <INPUT>

Arguments:
  <INPUT>  Path to a raw AV2 Annex B bitstream or IVF-wrapped Annex B stream, or `-` for standard input

Options:
      --json                 Emit the validation report as JSON
  -v, --verbose...           Increase logging verbosity (repeatable: -v, -vv, -vvv)
      --quiet                Silence all logging except errors
      --strict               Treat warnings as conformance failures
      --max-diagnostics <N>  Show at most N diagnostics, with a truncation notice for the rest. Does not change which diagnostics are computed, the summary counts, or the exit code
      --summary-only         Print only the summary counts and the conformance line (no per-diagnostic lines). Exit code is unchanged. Distinct from the global `--quiet` (logging)
  -h, --help                 Print help
  -V, --version              Print version
